<BaseLayout
  title="3 Ways I Actually Save Money - Caleb McGennis"
  description="Real money-saving strategies that work for our family: cashback apps like Upside, using credit card rewards for Christmas gifts, and the $5 gift that means more than anything you'll find at the mall."
  type="article"
  publishedTime="2026-02-11"
  author="Caleb McGennis"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-soho-white py-20 md:py-32 px-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <a href="/blog/entrepreneur-ai" class="inline-flex items-center text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors mb-8">
