          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Entrepreneur in a World of AI
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
        3 Ways I Actually Save Money
      </h1>
      <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-brass-horizontal rounded-full shadow-sm mb-8"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-500">
          <span>By Caleb McGennis</span>
          <span>&bull;</span>
          <time datetime="2026-02-11">February 11, 2026</time>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://themcgennisfamily.com/blog/entrepreneur-ai/ways-i-save-money" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 bg-mcgennis-navy hover:bg-opacity-90 text-white rounded-lg transition-all text-xs font-medium shadow-sm hover:shadow-md" aria-label="Share on Facebook">
